 bed at ten."],"explanation":"Always — doim, usually — odatda, often — tez-tez, sometimes — ba’zan, never — hech qachon. Bular aniq matematik foiz emas. Asosiy fe’ldan oldin: I often read. To be dan keyin: She is always ready. Never allaqachon inkor ma’nosida: I never go. Standart shaklda I don’t never go ishlatmang. Every day va twice a week aniq takror jadvalini bildiradi.","hint":"I often read. / She is always ready. / twice a week","tokens":["I","usually","go","to","bed","at","ten."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-a1-16","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-a1-16","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-grammar","name":"British Council — Grammar","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"grammar","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/grammar","task":"Darajangizdagi dars mavzusini toping va bitta o‘xshash misol yozing.","lesson":"en-a1-16","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-read","name":"British Council — Reading","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"reading","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/reading","task":"O‘z darajangizdagi matnni t